                                                "sense_id": "a9ac7e2f-66d8-3bb3-b020-774a75766b8d",
                                                "text": "I am the Ionian Minotaur, the mightiest\nOf all Europa’s taurine progeny—\nI am the old traditional Man-Bull;"
