                                                "sense_id": "729b3afa-d43b-3f06-bbab-a27f9ea132fc",
                                                "text": "Researchers found that a high daily dose of taurine, an amino acid commonly added to energy drinks and naturally found in various foods, helped to delay death and mitigate against the biological ravages of aging."
                                            }
